  "title": "HTTP3: Fix an initialization",
  "description": "Fix\n\n```\n*** CID 1543202:  Uninitialized variables  (UNINIT)\n/builds/wireshark/wireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-http3.c: 1110 in http3_session_lookup_or_create()\n1104         quic_cid_t initial_dcid;\n1105         if (quic_conn_data_get_conn_client_dcid_initial(pinfo, &initial_dcid)) {\n1106             /* Look up the session data in the conn map */\n1107             http3_session = (http3_session_info_t *)wmem_map_lookup(HTTP3_CONN_INFO_MAP, &initial_dcid);\n1108             if (http3_session == NULL) {\n1109                 quic_cid_t *dcid_p = wmem_new0(wmem_file_scope(), quic_cid_t);\n>>>     CID 1543202:  Uninitialized variables  (UNINIT)\n>>>     Using uninitialized value \"initial_dcid\". Field \"initial_dcid.reset_token\" is uninitialized.\n1110                 *dcid_p = initial_dcid;\n1111                 http3_session = http3_session_new();\n1112                 wmem_map_insert(HTTP3_CONN_INFO_MAP, dcid_p, http3_session);\n1113             }\n1114         } else {\n1115             /* Initial DCID can not be found, use the 5-tuple for lookup */\n```",
